			"Message": "style(Mountain): simplify entry point comments in Library.rs\n\nClean up documentation comments for the main entry point function:\n- Simplify module-level comment from explanatory to concise \"Entry Point\"\n- Update doc comment to explicitly state \"both mobile and desktop builds\"\n\nThese are minor documentation improvements for clarity without changing any functionality.",
